    <summary>Portable Windows dev server - Caddy, PHP, MySQL/MariaDB, PostgreSQL, SQLite, and Mailpit with automatic local HTTPS.</summary>
    <description>
JengaDev is a portable local development server for Windows, built as an alternative to XAMPP and Laragon.

- Automatic local HTTPS for every hosted site via Caddy - no manual certificate setup
- Multiple switchable PHP versions
- MySQL/MariaDB, PostgreSQL, and SQLite, each with an admin UI (phpMyAdmin/Adminer)
- Mailpit built in for catching outgoing mail from hosted sites
- Managed from a browser dashboard, opened automatically on launch

Requires administrator rights to install (it installs and manages local services, and secures its own install folder against tampering by other local accounts).
    </description>
    <releaseNotes>https://github.com/mtaalamtech/jengadev/releases/tag/v1.0.25</releaseNotes>
